<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of Aug 1, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Aug 1    WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 11,456  9,214   7,409</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				 23     24     121</p>
<p>CCC						827    827     864</p>
<p>TOTAL					 12,306 10,065   8,394</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 22,775 22,485   4,582</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				227    204     212</p>
<p>CCC					    3,558  2,558   1,887</p>
<p>TOTAL					 26,560 25,247   6,681</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
